# 1. PRODUCT IDENTITY

Product name: LIVING MEMORY

Tagline: Your life, continuously understood.

Product description:

LIVING MEMORY is an AI-powered personal context intelligence platform that connects information from WhatsApp groups, Gmail, Google Calendar, documents, PDFs, images and conversations.

It does not simply summarize information.

It:
- Remembers important information.
- Connects related information across different sources.
- Understands people, projects, decisions and responsibilities.
- Tracks how information changes over time.
- Detects contradictions and missing information.
- Understands how one change affects other activities.
- Recovers forgotten context.
- Identifies what needs attention.
- Helps users anticipate what may matter next.

Core product philosophy:

COLLECT → REMEMBER → CONNECT → UNDERSTAND → ANTICIPATE.

This must be reflected throughout the UI.

